在**线性相关结构**（Linear Correlation Structure）中，当时间差（即 $|t_2 - t_1|$）**超过参数 $\rho_i$** 时，两个时间点之间的相关性（correlation）将变为 **0**。

具体来说，该结构定义如下：

$$
\mathrm{corr}\Big(Y_{i,t_1,j},Y_{i,t_2,k}\Big) = c_i(|t_2 - t_1|) = 
\begin{cases}
1 - \left(\frac{|t_2 - t_1|}{\rho_i}\right), & \text{当 } |t_2 - t_1| < \rho_i \\
0, & \text{否则}
\end{cases}
$$

因此，当时间差大于或等于 $\rho_i$ 时，相关性不再随时间差变化，而是被设定为 **0**，表示两个观测之间不再存在线性时间相关性。这种设计体现了时间相关性随着时差增加而递减的假设，并在超过一定时间阈值后完全消失。

The indicator transform used in indicator kriging is defined as a binary transformation of the original data $ z(\mathbf{x}_{\alpha}) $. For a given threshold $ z_q $, the indicator transform is mathematically expressed as:

$$
i(\mathbf{x}_{\alpha}; z_{q}) = \left\{ 
\begin{array}{ll}
1 & \text{if } z(\mathbf{x}_{\alpha}) \leq z_{q}, \\
0 & \text{otherwise}.
\end{array} 
\right.
$$

This transformation converts the data into proportions below and above a series of selected thresholds $ z_q $, where $ q = 1, \ldots, Q $. Each threshold corresponds to a binary variable that indicates whether the data value at a location $ \mathbf{x}_{\alpha} $ is less than or equal to $ z_q $. This process forms the foundation for further steps in the indicator kriging model, such as variogram estimation and conditional probability calculation.
